# The Attenborough cloning voice's model files are 186 MB together, and decoder.onnx
# alone (124.7 MB) is past the 100 MB ceiling a public git host will accept. They are an
# asset on the GitHub Release instead, installed by tools/voice/fetch_attenborough.py,
# which verifies every file against the hash of the model the voice was measured with.
# The reference clip and its text stay in the repository: they are the editorial part of
# this voice rather than a download.
app/src/main/assets/tts/en_GB-attenborough/decoder.onnx
app/src/main/assets/tts/en_GB-attenborough/encoder.onnx
app/src/main/assets/tts/en_GB-attenborough/vocoder.onnx
app/src/main/assets/tts/en_GB-attenborough/lexicon.txt
app/src/main/assets/tts/en_GB-attenborough/tokens.txt
app/src/main/assets/tts/en_GB-attenborough/.incoming-*/

